/60px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fetid Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Fetid Fumes (Condition)\">Fetid Fumes</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;2 m (7 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;2 m (7 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The fumes emanating from the Fetid Ooze eat away at the affected entity, so long as it stays within 2 m (7 ft).</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> at the start of each round.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects <a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Ooze\" title=\"Fetid Ooze\">Fetid Ooze</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Fetid_Aura\">Creatures with Fetid Aura</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Ooze\" title=\"Fetid Ooze\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png/30px-Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png/45px-Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png/60px-Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fetid Ooze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png/30px-Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Portrait_Fetid_Ooze.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Ooze\" title=\"Fetid Ooze\">Fetid Ooze</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>TWN_OOZE_PUTRID_AURA</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Fetid_Aura\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon